        "role": "user",
        "text": "A young woman with shoulder-length black hair, featuring darker roots and lighter tips, stands against a textured white wall. She wears a beige triangle bikini top under an off-white crochet cardigan draped over her shoulders; the garment has large, openwork sleeves that fall loosely to her elbows. Her right hand gently touches behind her ear as she looks toward the camera with soft eyes and slightly parted lips. Around her neck are two layered pieces of jewelry: one is a string of white seashell beads with gold accents, while another delicate chain holds a small shell pendant. She also wears large hoop earrings that catch light from above; faint freckles dot her cheeks beneath subtle makeup. Her pose leans into the wall's corner as if resting casually against it, and she appears relaxed in this outdoor setting under bright daylight. The lighting is soft yet direct, casting gentle shadows on her skin while illuminating highlights across her hairline and cheekbones. Taken from a slightly elevated eye-level perspective at close range with tight framing that emphasizes upper body details, the composition draws focus to her face, jewelry, and hands as she interacts subtly with herself through gesture."
